            "steam_appid": 642860,
            "required_age": "10",
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/642860/extras/3b1eaf82c3e69eb5fe386705f834cc9a.avif?t=1585453607\" width=535 height=184 /></span><br><br><strong>Battle Army</strong> is a multiplayer FPS, giving players the ability to change the weapons and equipment of their characters. Immerse yourself in a nervous universe, aggressive and manageable at the same time. <br>Run through many battlefields to fulfill the set objective, kill the enemies that will block your path and accomplish your mission. <br>Two teams compete in different modes and varied. <br>In constant evolution, the Battle Army game will propose new weapons, new costumes or new cards so that players of all levels can create unique and different characters.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features Of the Game</strong></h2>Character customization <br>3 Game Modes<br>Fps Easy to handle <br>Playable Up 6 Vs 6<br>4 Dynamic Battle Cards <br>An Interactive Menu to Prepare Before the Battle<br>20 Levels <br>Customization Classes <br>A Ranking <br>Silver system (the more you play the more you are rich)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Where Is the Development Of Battle Army?</strong></h2><br><strong>Battle Army</strong> is currently playable alpha version released in early access on Steam in <strong>early 2018. </strong><br>The basics of the game are ready and will be soon improved, balanced if necessary based on player feedback.<br>With your participation and your constructive criticism, we will evolve Battle Army, we will add new equipment, new maps, new mods and much more ... <br>We develop the game with you thanks to our forum where you can post your ideas <br>Support the <strong>Battle Army</strong> video game to start a new adventure.",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/642860/extras/3b1eaf82c3e69eb5fe386705f834cc9a.avif?t=1585453607\" width=535 height=184 /></span><br><br><strong>Battle Army</strong> is a multiplayer FPS, giving players the ability to change the weapons and equipment of their characters. Immerse yourself in a nervous universe, aggressive and manageable at the same time. <br>Run through many battlefields to fulfill the set objective, kill the enemies that will block your path and accomplish your mission. <br>Two teams compete in different modes and varied. <br>In constant evolution, the Battle Army game will propose new weapons, new costumes or new cards so that players of all levels can create unique and different characters.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features Of the Game</strong></h2>Character customization <br>3 Game Modes<br>Fps Easy to handle <br>Playable Up 6 Vs 6<br>4 Dynamic Battle Cards <br>An Interactive Menu to Prepare Before the Battle<br>20 Levels <br>Customization Classes <br>A Ranking <br>Silver system (the more you play the more you are rich)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Where Is the Development Of Battle Army?</strong></h2><br><strong>Battle Army</strong> is currently playable alpha version released in early access on Steam in <strong>early 2018. </strong><br>The basics of the game are ready and will be soon improved, balanced if necessary based on player feedback.<br>With your participation and your constructive criticism, we will evolve Battle Army, we will add new equipment, new maps, new mods and much more ... <br>We develop the game with you thanks to our forum where you can post your ideas <br>Support the <strong>Battle Army</strong> video game to start a new adventure.",
